    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ko̱r kɛ ji̱ Pi-li-thɛt",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13:1",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Tha̱a̱ŋ buɔkni thilɛ kɛ cio̱k kä 1. Duundɛ ɣöö kä Ɣi-bɛ-ru cio̱k kä 1 tëë thi̱n kä te tha̱a̱ŋdɛ jɔ̱ɔ̱r. Kä Ɣi-bɛ-ru ciök kä kɛl wee i̱, “Thɔɔl tëë kɛ run ti… mëë tookɛ kuäär, kä cuɛ I-thɛ-rɛl ruac kɛ run…”",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Thɔɔl nɛy ti bathdɔɔri diɔ̱k kuany kä ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl. Cu nɛy ti bathdɔɔri rɛw te kɛɛl kɛ Thɔɔl kä Mik-mac, kɛnɛ wec päämni Beth-ɛl, kä cu nɛy ti bathdɔɔr te kɛɛl kɛ Jo-na-than kä Giba wec Ben-ya-min. Kä cuɛ duɔth nath jak kä wä dho̱rikiɛn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Jo-na-than ji̱ Pi-li-thɛt tin te kä Gabä joc, kä cu ji̱ Pi-li-thɛt ɛ liŋ. Kä cu Thɔɔl kaaŋ koth rɛy wec kɛɛliw wee i̱ “Ɛ ji̱ Ɣi-bɛ-ru liŋ jɛ.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ji̱ Pi-li-thɛt diaal ɛ liŋ ɛn ɣöö ci Thɔɔl ji̱ Pi-li-thɛt joc, kɛnɛ ɣöö ca ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl lo̱k ɛ ji̱ Pi-li-thɛt. Kä cu ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl rɔ cɔl kɛ ɣöö bikɛ rɔ̱ ma̱t Thɔɔl kä Gil-gal.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ji̱ Pi-li-thɛt rɔ dol kɛ ɣöö bikɛ nyiëëny kɛ I-thɛ-rɛl, thurbiɛɛli ti bathdɔɔri ti jiɛɛn diɔ̱k, kɛ jiöŋkööri ti bathdɔɔri bäkɛl, kɛ rɛm mi di̱i̱t ce̱tdɛ nikɛ liɛt yiëër kɛ ŋuan. Cukɛ ben pua̱t kä Mik-mac, nhiam ɣɔaa kä Beth-a-wɛn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mëë ci ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl ɛ nɛn i̱ ci ciaaŋdiɛn bɛ̈c, (Kɛ ɣöö ci naath cuuc), cukɛ rɔ tɛ̱̈ɛ̱̈ rɛy kɔ̱a̱kni, kɛ rɛy päämni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu tha̱a̱ŋkiɛn kir Jɔr-dɛn jiath kui̱c, wäkɛ muun Gad kɛnɛ Gil-yad. Cu Thɔɔl ŋot kä Gil-gal, kä nɛy diaal tëë te kɛɛl kɛ jɛ cuɛ kɛ lath kɛ dual.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cuɛ liep ɛn wi̱ni kɛ ni̱n bärɔw, tëë ca lar ɛ Tha-muɛl. Duundɛ ɣöö /Ken Tha-muɛl ben kä Gil-gal, kä cu naath wee däk piny kä jɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Thɔɔl wee i̱, “Nöŋɛ ɣä muc in waŋkɛ, kɛnɛ muc malä.” Kä cuɛ muc in waŋkɛ thöp. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä niɛ min thukɛ kɛ thöp mucä in waŋkɛ, cu Tha-muɛl cop. Kä cu Thɔɔl ɛ wä lor kä cuɛ jɛ ner. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Tha-muɛl wee i̱, “Ɛŋu ci la̱t ɔ?” Kä cu Thɔɔl ɛ loc i̱, “Min cä nath nɛn däkɛ piny kä ɣä, kä /keni ben kɛ ni̱n tëë ci lar, kä ci ji̱ Pi-li-thɛt rɔ̱ dol kä Mik-mac, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cua̱ cu wee i̱, ‘Dɔ̱ŋ bi ji̱ Pi-li-thɛt ɣä ben ma̱k kä Gil-gal, a /ka̱n Kuoth Nhial pal.’ Cua̱ cu jëk ni ɣöö bä muc in waŋkɛ thöp.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Tha-muɛl ɛ jiök i̱, “Ci lät ni dɔ̱ɔ̱rä, /keni lueek Kuɔth Nhial Kuothdu tit, tëë cɛ la̱t ji̱. Kɛ ɣöö dëë Kuoth Nhial ji̱ jak kä kuäär kä I-thɛ-rɛl amäni cäŋ kɛl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duundɛ ɣöö täämɛ /ci kuääru bi cuɔ̱p. Ci Kuoth Nhial raan lɔacdɛ go̱r. Kä cɛ jɛ kuany ala bööth nɛɛnikɛ, kɛ ɣöö /Keni min ca la̱r ji̱ ɛ Kuoth Nhial liŋ.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Tha-muɛl jiɛɛn kä Gil-gal wee kä Giba wec Ben-ya-min.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Thɔɔl nɛy tin te kɛɛl kɛ jɛ kuɛn ala nɛy ti kur bäkɛl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Thɔɔl kɛnɛ Jo-na-than gatdɛ, kɛ nɛy tin te kɛɛl kɛ kɛ cieŋ kä Gabä wec Ben-ya-min. Kä cu ji̱ Pi-li-thɛt pua̱t kä Mik-mac. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ji̱ nyuɔɔni ben raar wi̱c ji̱ Pi-li-thɛt kɛ bun da̱ŋ diɔ̱k. Cu buɔ̱n kɛl wä lotdɛ ni Ɔp-ra mun Cu-al, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu buɔ̱n in dɔ̱ŋ wä lotdɛ ni Beth-o-ron, kä buɔ̱n in dɔ̱ŋ cuɛ lot ni ke̱y in te lotdä lo̱o̱lä Dhɛ-bo-im min wä därdɔaar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä täämɛ thilɛ dëth ti te muun I-thɛ-rɛl Kɛɛliw. Kɛ ɣöö laar ji̱ Pi-li-thɛt ɛ i̱, “/Ci ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl rɔ bi lɛ ta̱th mutni.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duundɛ ɣöö ku ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl puɔ̱rikiɛn, kɛ carcaarikiɛn, kɛ jiöpnikiɛn kɛ cɔapnikiɛn la wä thɛr kä ji̱ Pi-li-thɛt. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku kɛ yiëëth la thöp kɛ pa̱t cueecä ɣɔ̱ɔ̱k kɛnɛ thër puɔ̱r, yio̱w da̱ŋ rɛw kɛ thër jiöp kɛnɛ carcaar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inɔ kɛ ni̱n ko̱o̱r thilɛ ram mi te tëtdɛ kɛ mut kä nɛy tin te kɛɛl kɛ Thɔɔl kɛnɛ gatdɛ ni Jo-na-than ɛ ni Thɔɔl puɔ̱nydɛ kɛnɛ gatdɛ ni Jo-na-than. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ji̱ Pi-li-thɛt wä wa duɔ̱ɔ̱p Mik-mac yien.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
